# Frontend-focused global control

**mk-dashboard (Vue-Dashboard)** — Vue 3 + Vite + Pinia + Vue Router + SCSS + Firebase. Treat UI work as **frontend-first** by default.

## Where rules live

| Location | Role |
|----------|------|
| `.cursor/frontend/rules/` | Detailed CSS, HTML/Vue, and JS standards |
| `.cursor/frontend/commands/` | CSS audit and reflow detection workflows |
| `src/assets/css/` | Design tokens, reset, utilities |
| `src/components/ui/` | Reusable UI components |

## Frontend tasks

UI, SCSS/CSS, Vue SFCs, templates, styles, components, Figma-to-code, or anything under `src/`.

1. Load relevant files from `.cursor/frontend/rules/`
2. Reuse tokens from `src/assets/css/utils/sources/` and utilities from `src/assets/css/utils/components/`
3. Prefer existing UI in `src/components/ui/` before inventing new primitives
4. Mention which rule files you used

## Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| Framework | Vue 3 (`<script setup>`) |
| Bundler | Vite (`@` → `src/`) |
| State | Pinia |
| Routing | Vue Router (`src/router/index.js`, driven by `src/api/navigation.json`) |
| Styles | SCSS via `src/assets/css/main.scss`; component styles as `<style scoped lang="scss">` |
| Backend | Firebase / Firestore (`src/firebase.js`) |
| Lint | ESLint (`npm run lint`), Stylelint (`npm run lint:css`), Prettier |
| VCS | Git |

## Non-frontend / API-adjacent

Services live under `src/js/services/`. Keep API/data shape aligned with what Vue components consume; do not invent parallel REST layers unless asked.
